  <h1>There Is No Cure for the Guinea Worm. The World Nearly Erased It Anyway.</h1>
  <p class="dek">It has no vaccine and no medicine. In 1986 it struck 3.5 million people a year. Today, just 10 cases remain on Earth. This is how the world nearly ended it.</p>
